# Applies to every image built from this repo's root (docker/agent-base,
# docker/composer-app, harness/Dockerfile) - Docker only reads .dockerignore
# from the build context root, not from subdirectories, so this replaces
# harness/.dockerignore for any build that uses repo-root context (which all
# three now do, since composer-app and harness both need sibling access to
# dist/ for the shared wheel artifact - see multi-build.yml's build-wheels
# job). harness/.dockerignore is kept as-is for anyone building harness/
# standalone with harness/ itself as context.
#
# NOTE: does not exclude dist/ - unlike .gitignore, every image build here
# actually needs the pre-built wheels that land there.

.git
.github
.idea
.pytest_cache
.venv
venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.egg-info
**/*.egg-info
.eggs
.DS_Store
.env
.env.example
site
docs
tests
transcripts
harness/tests
harness/transcripts
composer-ui/node_modules
composer-ui/.next
